<%- include("../partials/head",{metaTitle,metaDescription}) %><main id="main"><section class="about-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">About ThaiGame.org</span><h1>Helping Thai games<br><em>be seen by more people</em></h1><p>A public discovery space for games made by Thai creators, games based on Thai play traditions, and games with Thai art, stories, or culture at their core.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container story"><article><span>01</span><h2>Not a store, not a file host</h2><p>We keep promotional information, images, and YouTube IDs only. Buying and downloading happen on external websites.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h2>A broad definition of Thai games</h2><p>Thai-made teams, games based on local knowledge, and games with Thai art direction or story themes all belong here.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h2>Creators control visibility</h2><p>Creators can open a public profile for contact, or publish a game without exposing personal profile details.</p></article></div></section></main><%- include("../partials/footer") %>
